#: ../../../prop_tgt/AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS.rst:2
msgid "AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_tgt/AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS.rst:6
msgid ""
"On AIX, enable or disable :prop_tgt:`VERSION` and :prop_tgt:`SOVERSION` file "
"names for a ``SHARED`` library target that is built as a plain shared "
"object, i.e., when :prop_tgt:`AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_ARCHIVE` is disabled. This "
"property has no effect on shared library archives."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_tgt/AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS.rst:11
msgid ""
"If enabled, the shared object is named ``lib<name>.so.<version>`` and "
"symlinks ``lib<name>.so.<soversion>`` and ``lib<name>.so`` are created, as "
"on other UNIX platforms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_tgt/AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS.rst:15
msgid ""
"AIX shared objects have no builtin soname, so a dependent records the name "
"of the file used to link it.  CMake links dependents through the "
"``lib<name>.so.<soversion>`` symlink so they depend on that name at "
"runtime.  If :prop_tgt:`SOVERSION` is not set, dependents link to "
"``lib<name>.so.<version>`` instead.  Projects that do not want dependents to "
"record the full version should set :prop_tgt:`SOVERSION`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_tgt/AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS.rst:22
msgid ""
"If disabled, a single ``lib<name>.so`` file is produced and "
"the :prop_tgt:`VERSION` and :prop_tgt:`SOVERSION` properties are ignored."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../prop_tgt/AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS.rst:25
msgid ""
"This property defaults to :variable:`CMAKE_AIX_SHARED_LIBRARY_SYMLINKS` if "
"that variable is set when a non-imported ``SHARED`` library target is "
"created by :command:`add_library`.  If this property is not set, the default "
"is determined by policy :policy:`CMP0227`."
msgstr ""
